{"seq":21,"slug":"platform-engineering-advanced","title":"平台工程进阶","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 平台工程进阶\n\n平台工程在 2026 年已从 Gartner Hype Cycle 的\"启蒙期\"进入全面落地阶段——80% 的大型软件工程组织拥有专职平台团队，Backstage 占据 IDP 市场约 89% 份额。然而，近 70% 的平台工程项目未能在 18 个月内实现 ROI。这一落差揭示了一个核心矛盾：技术就绪度已成熟，但组织实践尚未跟上。\n\n本 hub 聚焦于平台工程的\"深水区\"——当基础设施自动化和开发者门户不再是瓶颈时，真正决定成败的因素：产品思维、团队拓扑、架构契约、采纳策略与运营成熟度。\n\n## 与兄弟 hub 的分工\n\n本 hub 与同类目下的两个兄弟 hub 形成递进关系：\n\n- **平台工程（07_platform-engineering）**：覆盖基础概念、自助基础设施、开发者门户、工具链与治理演进的入门全景。如果你尚未了解 IDP、Golden Path、Service Catalog 等核心概念，请先完成该 hub。\n- **开发者体验工程（16_developer-experience-engineering）**：从开发者视角出发，关注内循环反馈、本地环境、工具链自动化与文档知识体系。与本 hub 的\"采纳\"章节形成互补——DX 工程解决\"开发者要什么\"，本 hub 解决\"平台团队如何系统性地交付它\"。\n\n本 hub 的定位是：在已建立基础平台能力之后，如何将 IDP 作为内部产品来运营、规模化推广并持续演进。\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n根据读者背景，建议以下路径：\n\n1. **平台团队负责人 / Tech Lead**：foundations → adoption → operations → architecture（先理解产品与组织模型，再深入技术）\n2. **平台工程师 / SRE**：architecture → operations → foundations → adoption（先掌握技术架构，再理解组织背景）\n3. **工程管理者 / VP of Engineering**：foundations(1_platform-as-product) → adoption → operations(2_platform-cost-governance)（聚焦 ROI 与治理）\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 熟悉容器编排（Kubernetes）与 IaC（Terraform / Crossplane）基本概念\n- 了解 CI/CD 流水线设计与 GitOps 模式\n- 推荐先完成「平台工程」hub 的 1_platform-foundations 与 3_developer-portal 章节\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"平台工程基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-as-product","title":"平台即产品思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/foundations/platform-as-product"},{"seq":2,"slug":"team-topologies-for-platforms","title":"平台团队的 Team Topologies 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/foundations/team-topologies-for-platforms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cognitive-load-management","title":"认知负荷管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/foundations/cognitive-load-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture","title":"平台架构设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backstage-idp-architecture","title":"Backstage 驱动的 IDP 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/architecture/backstage-idp-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-api-contract-design","title":"平台 API 契约设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/architecture/platform-api-contract-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"golden-paths-templates","title":"黄金路径与模板工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/architecture/golden-paths-templates"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"adoption","title":"平台采纳与推广","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/adoption","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-adoption-strategy","title":"平台采纳策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/adoption/platform-adoption-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"developer-self-service","title":"开发者自助服务设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/adoption/developer-self-service"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-maturity-model","title":"平台成熟度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/adoption/platform-maturity-model"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"平台运营与演进","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-observability-slo","title":"平台可观测性与 SLO 体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/operations/platform-observability-slo"},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-cost-governance","title":"平台成本治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/operations/platform-cost-governance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-augmented-platform","title":"AI 增强的平台工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/operations/ai-augmented-platform"}]}]}